-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Record 4 cut sigma_MAP/sigma_RW on |z|>2.5. That is circular: z = r/sigma, so
selecting large |z| selects small sigma mechanically. Withdrawn as evidence and
replaced with two statements that do not touch the outcome being explained.

